{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112033326233-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112041957\"/><p>女事主送院後證實不治。</p><p>昨日(11日)晚上11時44分，一名姓林(45歲)女子，在其位於沙田沙田正街11-17號住所內暈倒，其母親發現報案求助。救援人員接報到場，事主昏迷被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，其後被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T21:26:05.093876+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T19:33:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:57:14.941260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:19:30.525320+00:00","content_hash":"2bb8f501620594fe5d6e9d3819059e516978635ac1fe5ead6ce19ebbe4724252","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T21:26:05.093876+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}